WEBVTT

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:01.380
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.237 --> 00:00:04.819
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I can’t concentrate with the radio on.

00:00:04.997 --> 00:00:06.505
Please <b>turn it off</b>.

00:00:08.424 --> 00:00:09.215
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.048 --> 00:00:12.437
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> There’s a wet towel on the floor.

00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:13.603
<b>Pick it up</b>.

00:00:15.562 --> 00:00:16.449
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:17.307 --> 00:00:20.448
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> If you don’t know what the word means, <b>look it up</b>.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:23.240
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:24.118 --> 00:00:26.031
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Why have you taken your coat off?

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:27.306
<b>Put it on</b>!

00:00:29.282 --> 00:00:30.210
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.400
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> This book was very expensive.

00:00:33.743 --> 00:00:35.135
Please <b>look after it</b>.

00:00:37.089 --> 00:00:38.029
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:38.946 --> 00:00:41.351
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Why are you wearing your coat in here?

00:00:41.547 --> 00:00:42.664
<b>Take it off</b>!